  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "n00_intro",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          0,
          0
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "# Gantt Chart \u2014 a tutorial\n\nThis flow draws the same project four times, adding **one feature at each\nstage**, so you can see exactly what each setting does.\n\n**The table holds no dates for the work itself** \u2014 only how long each task\ntakes and which task waits for which. The Gantt node works the calendar out\nfrom those, which is why changing one duration re-plans everything after it.\n\nThe table is published once as a **Goto** and picked up by a **From** in each\nstage: a wire without the wire, so no line has to cross the whole canvas.\n\nOnly the last chart draws itself when this opens, to keep four browser views\nfrom loading at once. To see an earlier stage, right-click its node \u2192\n**Appearance\u2026** \u2192 tick **Draw this node's contents**.",
          "width": 460,
          "height": 300
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null
      },
      {
        "id": "n01_tasks",
        "type": "flograph.io.table",
        "pos": [
          1120,
          0
        ],
        "params": {
          "data": "{\"version\": 2, \"columns\": [{\"name\": \"id\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"task\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"phase\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"duration\", \"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"name\": \"depends_on\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"progress\", \"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"name\": \"owner\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"baseline_start\", \"type\": \"date\"}, {\"name\": \"baseline_finish\", \"type\": \"date\"}], \"rows\": [[\"D1\", \"Kickoff workshop\", \"Discovery\", 2, \"\", 100, \"Ada\", \"2026-09-07\", \"2026-09-09\"], [\"D2\", \"Stakeholder interviews\", \"Discovery\", 4, \"D1\", 100, \"Ada\", \"2026-09-09\", \"2026-09-14\"], [\"D3\", \"Content audit\", \"Discovery\", 5, \"D1\", 80, \"Kwame\", \"2026-09-09\", \"2026-09-15\"], [\"D4\", \"Requirements agreed\", \"Discovery\", 0, \"D2,D3\", 0, \"\", \"2026-09-15\", \"2026-09-15\"], [\"S1\", \"Wireframes\", \"Design\", 5, \"D4\", 60, \"Rosa\", \"2026-09-15\", \"2026-09-22\"], [\"S2\", \"Visual design\", \"Design\", 6, \"S1\", 20, \"Rosa\", \"2026-09-22\", \"2026-09-29\"], [\"S3\", \"Copywriting\", \"Design\", 7, \"D4\", 35, \"Kwame\", \"2026-09-15\", \"2026-09-22\"], [\"S4\", \"Design signed off\", \"Design\", 0, \"S2,S3\", 0, \"\", \"2026-09-29\", \"2026-09-29\"], [\"B1\", \"Page templates\", \"Build\", 8, \"S4\", 0, \"Ada\", \"2026-09-29\", \"2026-10-08\"], [\"B2\", \"CMS setup\", \"Build\", 4, \"S4\", 0, \"Ines\", \"2026-09-29\", \"2026-10-05\"], [\"B3\", \"Content load\", \"Build\", 5, \"B1,B2\", 0, \"Kwame\", \"2026-10-08\", \"2026-10-14\"], [\"B4\", \"QA pass\", \"Build\", 4, \"B3\", 0, \"Ines\", \"2026-10-14\", \"2026-10-19\"], [\"B5\", \"Accessibility fixes\", \"Build\", 3, \"B4\", 0, \"Rosa\", \"2026-10-19\", \"2026-10-21\"], [\"B6\", \"Go live\", \"Build\", 0, \"B5\", 0, \"\", \"2026-10-21\", \"2026-10-21\"]]}",
          "width": 960,
          "height": 420
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": "Website Rebuild"
      },
      {
        "id": "n02_goto",
        "type": "flograph.util.goto",
        "pos": [
          2320,
